{"id":"2244a38da8fc05f8","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-kripke-joyal-forcing-rules.md","title":"Theorem — 初等拓扑斯的强制联结词规则","display":"Theorem — 初等拓扑斯的强制联结词规则","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-kripke-joyal-forcing-rules","aliases":["14-thm-kripke-joyal-forcing-rules"],"display":"Theorem — 初等拓扑斯的强制联结词规则","depends_on":["[[14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing]]","[[14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics]]","[[14-df-subobject-quantifiers]]","[[14-thm-forcing-epimorphism-locality]]","[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-kripke-joyal-forcing-rules"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-kripke-joyal-forcing-rules</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 初等拓扑斯的强制联结词规则"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eeccd7d0ab927af1\" href=\"?note=eeccd7d0ab927af1\" title=\"14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing\">14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c22badb838a7fca1\" href=\"?note=c22badb838a7fca1\" title=\"14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics\">14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b6a2f7cb930ac02\" href=\"?note=0b6a2f7cb930ac02\" title=\"14-df-subobject-quantifiers\">14-df-subobject-quantifiers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28d5daffad807895\" href=\"?note=28d5daffad807895\" title=\"14-thm-forcing-epimorphism-locality\">14-thm-forcing-epimorphism-locality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"86c3a123f8ca1262\" href=\"?note=86c3a123f8ca1262\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures\">14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures</a> 的结构；公式解释与强制谓词采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c22badb838a7fca1\" href=\"?note=c22badb838a7fca1\" title=\"14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics\">14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"eeccd7d0ab927af1\" href=\"?note=eeccd7d0ab927af1\" title=\"14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing\">14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha:U\\to M_{\\vec x}\">\\(\\alpha:U\\to M_{\\vec x}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\)</span>。量词两式另取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in S_0\">\\(s\\in S_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\setminus|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\">\\(x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\setminus|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\cup\\{x\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\cup\\{x\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>下式的强制缩写保留上下文参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec z\">\\(\\vec z\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta:V\\to M_{\\vec z}\">\\(\\beta:V\\to M_{\\vec z}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\chi)\\subseteq|\\vec z|_{\\mathrm{var}}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(\\chi)\\subseteq|\\vec z|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_{(\\vec x,x)}=M_{\\vec x}\\times M_s\">\\(M_{(\\vec x,x)}=M_{\\vec x}\\times M_s\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"86c3a123f8ca1262\" href=\"?note=86c3a123f8ca1262\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures\">14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures</a> 的递归积。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{JointEpi2}\">\\(\\operatorname{JointEpi2}\\)</span> 的候选输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_0:U_0\\to U\">\\(i_0:U_0\\to U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_1:U_1\\to U\">\\(i_1:U_1\\to U\\)</span>，其共同消去条件在下式展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(V,\\beta)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec z}\\chi\\iff\\mathrm{Forces}_{\\mathcal E,M,\\vec z}(V,\\beta,\\chi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(V,\\beta)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec z}\\chi\\iff\\mathrm{Forces}_{\\mathcal E,M,\\vec z}(V,\\beta,\\chi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{JointEpi2}_{\\mathcal E}(i_0,i_1;U)\\iff\\forall T\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall g,h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(U,T)\\ (g\\circ i_0=h\\circ i_0\\land g\\circ i_1=h\\circ i_1\\Rightarrow g=h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{JointEpi2}_{\\mathcal E}(i_0,i_1;U)\\iff\\forall T\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall g,h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(U,T)\\ (g\\circ i_0=h\\circ i_0\\land g\\circ i_1=h\\circ i_1\\Rightarrow g=h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(U,\\alpha)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}(\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\iff\\bigl((U,\\alpha)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}\\varphi\\land(U,\\alpha)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}\\psi\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(U,\\alpha)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}(\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\iff\\bigl((U,\\alpha)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}\\varphi\\land(U,\\alpha)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}\\psi\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(U,\\alpha)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\iff\\forall V\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(V,U)\\ \\bigl((V,\\alpha\\circ u)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}\\varphi\\Rightarrow(V,\\alpha\\circ u)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}\\psi\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(U,\\alpha)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\iff\\forall V\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(V,U)\\ \\bigl((V,\\alpha\\circ u)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}\\varphi\\Rightarrow(V,\\alpha\\circ u)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}\\psi\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(U,\\alpha)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}(\\forall x:s\\,\\theta)\\iff\\forall V\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(V,U)\\ \\forall a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(V,M_s)\\quad(V,\\langle\\alpha\\circ u,a\\rangle)\\Vdash_{M,(\\vec x,x)}\\theta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(U,\\alpha)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}(\\forall x:s\\,\\theta)\\iff\\forall V\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(V,U)\\ \\forall a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(V,M_s)\\quad(V,\\langle\\alpha\\circ u,a\\rangle)\\Vdash_{M,(\\vec x,x)}\\theta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(U,\\alpha)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}(\\exists x:s\\,\\theta)\\iff\\exists V\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists e\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(V,U)\\ \\exists a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(V,M_s)\\quad\\bigl(\\operatorname{IsEpi}_{\\mathcal E}(e)\\land(V,\\langle\\alpha\\circ e,a\\rangle)\\Vdash_{M,(\\vec x,x)}\\theta\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(U,\\alpha)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}(\\exists x:s\\,\\theta)\\iff\\exists V\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists e\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(V,U)\\ \\exists a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(V,M_s)\\quad\\bigl(\\operatorname{IsEpi}_{\\mathcal E}(e)\\land(V,\\langle\\alpha\\circ e,a\\rangle)\\Vdash_{M,(\\vec x,x)}\\theta\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(U,\\alpha)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\iff\\exists U_0,U_1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists i_0\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(U_0,U)\\ \\exists i_1\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(U_1,U)\\quad\\bigl(\\operatorname{JointEpi2}_{\\mathcal E}(i_0,i_1;U)\\land(U_0,\\alpha\\circ i_0)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}\\varphi\\land(U_1,\\alpha\\circ i_1)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}\\psi\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(U,\\alpha)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\iff\\exists U_0,U_1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists i_0\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(U_0,U)\\ \\exists i_1\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(U_1,U)\\quad\\bigl(\\operatorname{JointEpi2}_{\\mathcal E}(i_0,i_1;U)\\land(U_0,\\alpha\\circ i_0)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}\\varphi\\land(U_1,\\alpha\\circ i_1)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x}\\psi\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 VI.6 的 Kripke–Joyal 语义。合取与蕴涵由子对象格及其右伴随；全称由投影右伴随。存在的子对象是像，沿其像分解满覆盖即可取得见证。析取是两子对象余积的像，因此允许分支覆盖；要求在 U 自身选同一分支会错误地强迫经典语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"eeccd7d0ab927af1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"c22badb838a7fca1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-quantifiers","status":"resolved","id":"0b6a2f7cb930ac02","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-quantifiers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-forcing-epimorphism-locality","status":"resolved","id":"28d5daffad807895","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-forcing-epimorphism-locality]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures","status":"resolved","id":"86c3a123f8ca1262","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt