}_s\\setminus|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}$、$\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)$，$\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\cup\\{x\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures","status":"resolved","id":"86c3a123f8ca1262","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"下式的强制缩写保留上下文参数 $\\vec z$；$\\beta:V\\to M_{\\vec z}$，$\\operatorname{FV}(\\chi)\\subseteq|\\vec z|_{\\mathrm{var}}$。$M_{(\\vec x,x)}=M_{\\vec x}\\times M_s$ 采用 [[14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures]] 的递归积。$\\operatorname{JointEpi2}$ 的候选输入为 $i_0:U_0\\to U$、$i_1:U_1\\to U$，其共同消去条件在下式展开。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha:U\\to M_{\\vec x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in S_0","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\setminus|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\cup\\{x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec z","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta:V\\to M_{\\vec z}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\chi)\\subseteq|\\vec z|_{\\mathrm{var}}","display":false},{"tex":"M_{(\\vec x,x)}=M_{\\vec x}\\times M_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{JointEpi2}","display":false},{"tex":"i_0:U_0\\to U","display":false},{"tex":"i_1:U_1\\to U","display":false},{"tex":"(V,\\beta)\\Vdash_{M,\\vec z}\\chi\\iff\\mathrm{Forces}_{\\mathcal E,M,\\vec z}(V,\\beta,\\chi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{JointEpi2}_{\\mathcal E}(i_0,i_1;U)\\iff\\forall T\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall g,h\\in\\operatorn